. Takes a user-allocated result object as a parameter and stores the result there (original method creates a new `Dictionary` on every call).\r\n\r\nThis is primarily useful for C# scripts because of GC, but the function will also be available in GDScript - I'm not sure if it makes sense there, but I don't know if there's a way to not expose it to GDScript.\r\n\r\nThere's been some talks about providing zero allocation C# API here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7842, but I do not know of any concrete plans or decisions made on how to approach this, so I implemented it in a way that makes sense to me.","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-04-18T23:29:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T20:07:09Z","closed_at":"2026-09-24T18:28:04Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"adamwych:intersect-ray-no-alloc","ref":"intersect-ray-no-alloc","repo":{"id":965379557,"node_id":"R_kgDOOYqF5Q","name":"godot","full_name":"adamwych/godot","owner":{"login":"adamwych","id":6526954,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MjY5NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6526954?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a